    "NP-completeness of aggregate root-dependent spanning-tree cost (v1.0, 6 October 2026), Alec Kriebel (ORCID 0009-0001-9320-500X). Resolves Kaibel Problem 1: aggregate whole-tree costs over all vertex roots; strongly NP-complete with costs {0,1,2}, also {1,2,3} after uniform shift. New resolution relative to inspected primary literature; no absolute-first or continued-open-status certification. Extensive AI use; unrefereed, without conventional human peer review. PR108; 30003996 / OWR-16633-013. Original author effort 2/5 (structured ledger absent); new central proof-search turns 0. PDF and exact verification/support archive published together."
  ],
